      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WIGGLE ROCKET (1) settled close the lead but was checked in the run and turned spotting a start, winding up strongly to place (20.65) at this track over 366m in a Maiden. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Given another chance. STINGER BEE (8) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at this track over 366m behind Detonate Diva (20.90) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. STYLIZER (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (20.45) in a Maiden at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Cannot be underestimated. ABHORRED (3) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
